    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f427b753a9397a0fbbecaf6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎，神明大人……？\r\n没想到能帮上他的忙，实在倍感光荣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68929979b7e92af466b45be843803d0bdf53fe1f4e2650888fcf7301e60d4893",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
