    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a64f550ed3977a763ea9b75a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟是神社嘛，\r\n说不定会发生一些不可思议的事情哦？\r\n比如遭遇妖怪，或是邂逅神使……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e691ab0742331c629205b05fe2f6bf3e0ed9b109dae7e2069d701e1bc15a328a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022707.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4da94c46f596fb09571bfb56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许是神明大人的赠礼罢——\r\n自那以后，美妙姿势的状态逐渐好转了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "109b8fcb2f804e4e0c76aef6ecff69c221ea25aefd91b5cb6da84784ce866e66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022707.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126bc9f5de59d40fd946eba1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我连忙追上美妙姿势，\r\n与她一同去确认这诡异声响的来源——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c67cdcdce047302f65edd97c8697d8ff4b0610df35b9f48513a942cc46c421a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
